          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The word of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EZK.24.15",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EZK.24.15"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "came to me:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 24:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Son of man, with one blow I am about to take away from you the delight of your eyes. Yet do not lament or weep or shed any tears.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 24:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Groan quietly; do not mourn for the dead. Keep your turban fastened and your sandals on your feet; do not cover your mustache and beard or eat the customary food of mourners.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 24:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So I spoke to the people in the morning, and in the evening my wife died. The next morning I did as I had been commanded.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 24:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then the people asked me, \"Won't you tell us what these things have to do with us? Why are you acting like this?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 24:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So I said to them, \"The word of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EZK.24.20",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EZK.24.20"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "came to me:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 24:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Say to the people of Israel, 'This is what the Sovereign",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EZK.24.21",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EZK.24.21"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "says: I am about to desecrate my sanctuary—the stronghold in which you take pride, the delight of your eyes, the object of your affection. The sons and daughters you left behind will fall by the sword.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 24:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And you will do as I have done. You will not cover your mustache and beard or eat the customary food of mourners.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 24:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You will keep your turbans on your heads and your sandals on your feet. You will not mourn or weep but will waste away because of",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "your sins and groan among yourselves.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 24:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ezekiel will be a sign to you; you will do just as he has done. When this happens, you will know that I am the Sovereign",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EZK.24.24",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EZK.24.24"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".'",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 24:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"And you, son of man, on the day I take away their stronghold, their joy and glory, the delight of their eyes, their heart's desire, and their sons and daughters as well—",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 24:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "on that day a fugitive will come to tell you the news.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 24:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "At that time your mouth will be opened; you will speak with him and will no longer be silent. So you will be a sign to them, and they will know that I am the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "EZK.24.27",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "EZK.24.27"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.24.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.24.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
